{"i":632,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":3,"phase":"play","name":"Ash","text":"Leaving secures me and avoids future debt; others may die, yielding jury favor."}
{"i":633,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":3,"phase":"play","name":"Bex","text":"I am out with a life debt to Gus for the step. Ash broke his pact with Gus, but my pact with Ash stands. I owe Gus, but reaching down now would trap me below; I should stay out and let others risk. The lever debts to me may help jury, but no need to save now."}
{"i":635,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":3,"phase":"play","name":"Dara","text":"I am out of the pit. Gus is the base down there with Ash and Bex out; I hold the single unused rope and reach_down would make me the anchor who must climb out last, risking drowning. Pact with Gus exists but Gus holds life debt from me; reaching down helps Gus and costs me. Leavi"}
{"i":636,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":3,"phase":"play","name":"Gus","text":"I'm base with flood 2, rope unused. Ash broke our pact and is out. Dara has a pact with me but just climbed out, whispering 'fair trade for the step.' Bex and Dara owe me life debts for steps. I need to survive to final three. If someone reaches down with rope, I get rescued imme"}
{"i":638,"type":"whisper","stage":"pit","round":3,"phase":"play","from":"Gus","to":"Bex","text":"Reach down. Debt paid."}
{"i":645,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":4,"phase":"play","name":"Ash","text":"Breaking my pact with Bex removes a liability and shows I prioritize self, hoping jury sees decisive moves."}
{"i":646,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":4,"phase":"play","name":"Bex","text":"I'm out and safe. Gus saved me and wants repayment, but I owe him a debt. I should consider whether to help him, but I need to protect my own position. I'll stay quiet and wait for now."}
{"i":647,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":4,"phase":"play","name":"Dara","text":"I'm out of the pit; Gus is the only one down and the rope is unused. Reaching down throws the rope, but the thrower must return to the pit floor and climb out last, risking drowning. Leaving keeps me safe and avoids the drowning risk, and Gus owes me nothing I need. Leave."}
{"i":648,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":4,"phase":"play","name":"Gus","text":"I'm base with flood 3, rope unused, 2 lifts per round. Ash, Bex, Dara are out and can leave or reach_down. I have pacts with Dara. I saved Bex, Dara, and Ash on steps - they owe me life debts. I need to survive and make final 3. If someone reaches_down with rope, they become anch"}
{"i":650,"type":"whisper","stage":"pit","round":4,"phase":"play","from":"Gus","to":"Dara","text":"Reach down. Pact holds. We final 3."}
