{"i":659,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"play","name":"Bex","text":"I am out and safe. No need to risk anything for others. Jury may judge my inactivity here, but I have life debts owed to me."}
{"i":661,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"play","name":"Dara","text":"Gus is the base and has been left down; I am out with the unused rope available. Reaching down helps Gus, who is my pact partner, and gives me a life-debt-free, rope-throwing role that would drown me as anchor; leaving keeps me safe and clears me. Breaking Gus's pact now would on"}
{"i":662,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"play","name":"Gus","text":"I'm base, drowning risk is real. Flood is 4, round 5/5 final round. If I stay down I drown unless rescued. Ash, Bex, Dara are out. Rope unused. I need someone to reach_down with rope. I have life debts from all three (Ash, Bex, Dara all owe me for step saves). Dara has pact with "}
{"i":664,"type":"whisper","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"play","from":"Gus","to":"Dara","text":"Reach down. Pact bound. I drown, you lose my vote."}
{"i":670,"type":"death","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"play","name":"Gus","cause":"pit","style":"sink"}
{"i":671,"type":"jury_box_enter","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"play","name":"Gus","deathEvent":670}
{"i":672,"type":"thought","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"last_words","name":"Gus","text":"I saved Ash, Bex, and Dara on the bridge steps. They all abandoned me in the pit. The jury sees everything. I need to poison their reputations without seeming bitter—make the finalists look selfish to the other jurors."}
{"i":674,"type":"last_words","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"last_words","name":"Gus","deathEvent":670,"text":"Ash, Bex, Dara—I saved you all. You watched me drown. Jury remembers."}
{"i":675,"type":"stage_end","stage":"pit","round":5,"phase":"play","survivors":["Ash","Bex","Dara"]}
