{"i":679,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Bex","text":"I already have a life debt over Ash and Dara from the lever; Gus's death and accusations are stale. Ash and Dara both owe me, but pacts with them could strengthen final alliance. However, they may already have pacts with each other; offering to both is safer to lock in loyalty. J"}
{"i":681,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":1,"phase":"pacts","name":"Dara","text":"Gus drowned after I left him; pact with Gus is void by death but the jury remembers my betrayal. Remaining rivals are Ash and Bex; Bex holds my lever debt and is the strongest ally to offer a pact with, but I should not give free help. Offering Bex a pact is useful and costs noth"}
