{"i":689,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Ash","text":"I offered Bex a pact; if she accepts I'll have two allies. I keep my current pact with Dara for now."}
{"i":690,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Bex","text":"Jury saw I saved Ash and Dara by lever and Gus by step. Accepting both pacts could ensure survival but might look like I'm pandering. Ash owes me a life debt, Dara too. I'll accept Dara's pact since she offered verbally; Ash's offer is also safe. I can accept both—no cost now, an"}
{"i":692,"type":"thought","stage":"pacts","round":2,"phase":"pacts","name":"Dara","text":"Bex has not accepted my pact offer and has two life debts owed to her from me, so she is valuable but unpredictable. Breaking the Ash pact now would signal betrayal to the jury, so I should keep my existing pacts and wait for Bex's answer rather than burn credibility."}
